{"4162580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hollowreach - Alone", "steam_appid": 4162580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hollowreach</strong> is a third-person, single-player psychological horror game centered on story, exploration, and environmental puzzles. Set in a decaying world shaped by loss and depression, the game invites players to uncover <strong>Nathan Ivanov’s story</strong>, as reality slowly collapses around him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/4f240343d59fd7eba1ba1259609deebf.poster.avif?t=1778792672\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/4f240343d59fd7eba1ba1259609deebf.webm?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/4f240343d59fd7eba1ba1259609deebf.mp4?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five years after the collapse of civilization, the silence of dead cities echoes through the halls of an old military academy that now shelters only echoes, memories… and hungry monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/032c2348e211303de1160345f4ad031b.poster.avif?t=1778792672\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/032c2348e211303de1160345f4ad031b.webm?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/032c2348e211303de1160345f4ad031b.mp4?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Nathan Ivanov</strong>, a young man who watched the world crumble at sixteen. After losing your parents to the infection and wandering through ruins alongside Anya — your girlfriend and only companion — hope slowly faded. Until the day she gave up, leaving behind only an unbearable silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/fd985693f72c892db28131ed412820c3.poster.avif?t=1778792672\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/fd985693f72c892db28131ed412820c3.webm?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/fd985693f72c892db28131ed412820c3.mp4?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, alone, <strong>Nathan</strong> must face not only the infected that haunt the place, but also the ghosts of his own mind. Each room holds a puzzle, each step a risk — and each memory, an open wound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/7213b2b18513ad2ff0bc944a980b09c7.poster.avif?t=1778792672\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/7213b2b18513ad2ff0bc944a980b09c7.webm?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/7213b2b18513ad2ff0bc944a980b09c7.mp4?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hollowreach – Alone</strong> combines psychological horror, tense action, and environmental puzzles to deliver an immersive third-person experience with a cinematic atmosphere and deep narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/3ef3aa2f7de77abd684d1d2f6be965b4.poster.avif?t=1778792672\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/3ef3aa2f7de77abd684d1d2f6be965b4.webm?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/3ef3aa2f7de77abd684d1d2f6be965b4.mp4?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hollowreach</strong> is a third-person, single-player psychological horror game centered on story, exploration, and environmental puzzles. Set in a decaying world shaped by loss and depression, the game invites players to uncover <strong>Nathan Ivanov’s story</strong>, as reality slowly collapses around him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/4f240343d59fd7eba1ba1259609deebf.poster.avif?t=1778792672\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/4f240343d59fd7eba1ba1259609deebf.webm?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/4f240343d59fd7eba1ba1259609deebf.mp4?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five years after the collapse of civilization, the silence of dead cities echoes through the halls of an old military academy that now shelters only echoes, memories… and hungry monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/032c2348e211303de1160345f4ad031b.poster.avif?t=1778792672\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/032c2348e211303de1160345f4ad031b.webm?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/032c2348e211303de1160345f4ad031b.mp4?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Nathan Ivanov</strong>, a young man who watched the world crumble at sixteen. After losing your parents to the infection and wandering through ruins alongside Anya — your girlfriend and only companion — hope slowly faded. Until the day she gave up, leaving behind only an unbearable silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/fd985693f72c892db28131ed412820c3.poster.avif?t=1778792672\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/fd985693f72c892db28131ed412820c3.webm?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162580/extras/fd985693f72c892db28131ed412820c3.mp4?t=1778792672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, alone, <strong>Nathan</strong> must face not only the infected that haunt the place, but also the ghosts of his own mind. Each room holds a puzzle, each step a risk — and each memory, an open wound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po